pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# Output-frame paced long drive for stability. Enters the Gauntlet like
# fh1-race-sync, then drives about 7,000 frames with throttle, alternating
# steering and occasional braking (it may end against a barrier: the route checks
# stability and rendering, not driving), and captures every 1,000 frames.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
wait 1400 3000 vehicle
capture 1560 event-ready
input 1680 4000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1686 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1860 event-entered
input 2040 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2046 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
wait 2050 1200 file thumbnail_
capture 2220 car-select
input 2400 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2406 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
wait 2410 3000 file replay_stream
input 2530 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2536 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2650 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2656 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
